&lt;h2 style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:x-large; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;NIVEL 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Anota 7 goles para completar el nivel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Evita los obstáculos y encuentra espacios para disparar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:x-large; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;NIVEL 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Juega un emocionante 1vs1 contra Mr Peanutbatter, toma los power-ups e intenta ganarle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:x-large; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;CONTROLES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
